1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,680
 Each week, we prayerfully receive the sacrament and witness before God and in the presence

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:12,640
 of others that we are willing to take upon ourselves the name of Jesus Christ and always

3
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:16,040
 remember Him and keep His commandments.

4
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:24,480
 Then, with courage, we are true to our covenants and in turn, the Lord blesses us with increased

5
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,160
 faith.

6
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:30,080
 It is our faith in Jesus Christ that gives us the courage.

